  'Ask what ends the escort record.',
  '“The agreed destination, the time of arrival and confirmation that the escort is finished,” Sabine says. Aurelia taps the final line. “Then the next watch knows there is nobody to follow. I want that spoken as well as written.”',
  'Ask to hear their demonstration goodbye.',
