SPECIALIST_VOICES={
 'koharu':('“I want a bench that makes the next repair easier, not one that makes me look indispensable.”','“There. Enough room for somebody else’s hands beside mine.”','“The good part is watching somebody try their own method here.”'),
 'zahra':('“Fit the station to the work and the worker. The smith should not have to wrestle both.”','“Now the useful tools are where a tired hand expects them.”','“A smoother job is a fine thing. Coming away with energy left is finer.”'),
 'fenna':('“The best tavern notices tell you who can help, not who wants to sound important.”','“A place for routes, spare thread and names worth remembering.”','“Somebody left a useful note without being asked. That is when an exchange starts working.”'),
 'iona':('“A good dispatch desk lets a letter leave without losing the person behind it.”','“The outgoing work has a place. So do the replies worth keeping.”','“We are doing more useful correspondence without asking anyone to write through supper.”'),
 'kaede':('“I want a practice circle where control matters more than an audience.”','“The marks are clear. The stop signal is clearer.”','“I like seeing someone finish a drill pleased, rather than merely exhausted.”'),
 'tamsin':('“Preserving is mostly arranging things so tomorrow’s cook can be grateful to today’s.”','“Nothing glamorous. A pantry that lets good work last.”','“Less wasted effort, more choice about what to do with a harvest. That feels like care.”'),
 'elowen':('“Preparation should have a quiet place. I cannot promise an easy day, but I can help us meet it ready.”','“There is room to prepare one more working without crowding the others.”','“I like seeing people choose what they need, rather than what they are afraid to leave out.”'),
 'nyssara':('“An assay bench should make uncertainty visible. That is how an enchanter earns trust.”','“A measured sample, a clear result and no theatrical promises.”','“The useful result is knowing why this material will hold the working.”'),
 'neris':('“Warmth should be adjustable. Comfort is not a single answer for every body.”','“Try the dry ledge first, if you prefer. The pools are an invitation.”','“Someone stayed simply because it felt pleasant. I call that a good design.”'),
 'aurelia':('“A watch light should help someone see without making every window feel observed.”','“The shutters work from a resting hand. A tired watcher deserves good tools.”','“A clear briefing and an ordinary quiet watch. I am learning to value both.”'),
 'sylva':('“Give new growth room and a sensible place to begin. The rest is attention.”','“These beds will support more cuttings while people are here to tend them.”','“Useful growth, with enough room for a few surprises. I like what we made.”'),
}

