ACTIVITY_THOUGHTS={
 'mira':{'common-room':'“I like a game where the conversation can win.”','library':'“Read that bit again. Not because it is important; because you enjoyed it.”','kitchen':'“A recipe is a remarkably opinionated kind of history.”','conservatory':'“An archive that keeps growing new pages. Charming and deeply inconvenient.”','training-yard':'“I have decided a graceful pause counts as progress.”','hot-spring':'“A book would be a mistake here. I suppose I shall have to enjoy the company.”','chapel':'“Some thoughts improve when nobody tries to catalogue them.”','workshop':'“Someone’s useful little correction. That is the part I want to keep.”','smithy':'“A worn handle can tell you where the work actually happened.”','command-room':'“I vote for somewhere with a good second-hand bookshop.”','infirmary':'“No advice? An unusually restful consultation.”','enchanting-room':'“A lovely thing that does nothing. I defend its right to remain so.”','guard-barracks':'“The best watch report must surely be ‘everyone came home’.”'},
 'tamsin':{'common-room':'“Stay for another round. I promise not to tidy the board while you are thinking.”','library':'“I like pages that remember being opened.”','kitchen':'“The useful part is cooking for the people who are actually here.”','conservatory':'“Tell me what likes to grow before I make a menu of it.”','training-yard':'“I am learning not to apologise for asking for a slower demonstration.”','hot-spring':'“Someone else can keep track of the towels for five minutes.”','chapel':'“It is nice to share quiet without having to fill it.”','workshop':'“This is the bowl I would mend instead of replace.”','smithy':'“Fit it for the hand that will use it. I have opinions about ladles.”','command-room':'“A journey should include a sensible place to eat.”','infirmary':'“I brought company, not another job.”','enchanting-room':'“If it is lovely without a charm, we can leave the charm off.”','guard-barracks':'“A clear place for somebody’s supper is part of a good watchroom.”'},
 'iona':{'common-room':'“An evening without an itinerary. I think we can manage.”','library':'“I enjoy a second account more than a perfect copy.”','kitchen':'“Recipes travel astonishing distances without once asking for a map.”','conservatory':'“A place worth staying in is a very good reason not to plan a journey.”','training-yard':'“Tell me where you want to stop before we begin.”','hot-spring':'“No dispatch is going to improve by being read in the steam.”','chapel':'“We need not have arrived by the same road to sit together.”','workshop':'“Keep the travelling marks. They tell me somebody brought it home.”','smithy':'“The practical detail is usually what gets somebody safely to the next stop.”','command-room':'“For this map, let us mark where we would like to linger.”','infirmary':'“Sometimes the most useful message is that nothing is urgently needed.”','enchanting-room':'“No annotation required. I like the shape too.”','guard-barracks':'“A place to return to changes the whole meaning of a route.”'},
}
